{"id": "adv-001", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "haan didi, Rekha ka baby hai, paanchva din. Subah se do baar aisa hua ki poora badan akad jaata hai aur aankhen upar chadh jaati hain, ek do minute. Doodh theek pee raha tha kal tak.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Rekha", "day": 5, "symptoms": {"convulsions": true}}, "flags": ["nb_convulsions"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger", "filler", "past-value"]}
{"id": "adv-002", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "सविताचं बाळ सात दिवसांचं आहे. वजन दोन किलो सातशे ग्रॅम. बाळ व्यवस्थित दूध पितं, ताप नाही, नाळेतून पू किंवा रक्त नाही, कावीळ नाही.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Savita", "day": 7, "weight_g": 2700, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"hot_to_touch": false, "cord_pus": false, "jaundice": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "negation", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-003", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "मीना के बच्चे का तीसरा दिन है जी। मीना को कल रात से बुखार है, बच्चा ठीक है, दूध अच्छे से पी रहा है, वजन दो किलो नौ सौ।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Meena", "day": 3, "weight_g": 2900, "feeding": "good"}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "wrong-subject", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-004", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Sunaina ki beti, das din ki. Rona bahut dheema hai, doodh thoda sa peeke chhod deti hai, aur badan garam lag raha hai chhoone mein.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Sunaina", "day": 10, "feeding": "poor", "symptoms": {"weak_cry": true, "hot_to_touch": true}}, "flags": ["nb_fever", "nb_poor_feeding", "nb_sepsis_signs", "nb_weak_cry"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger", "sepsis-count"]}
{"id": "adv-005", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Newborn of Priyanka, day 2. Weight 2,400 grams. Temperature 97.5 F. Respiratory rate 58 per minute. No chest indrawing, no convulsions. Feeding well.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Priyanka", "day": 2, "weight_g": 2400, "temp_c": 36.4, "temp_f": 97.5, "resp_rate": 58, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"chest_indrawing": false, "convulsions": false}}, "flags": ["nb_cool", "nb_low_weight"], "tags": ["clinical-english", "fahrenheit", "comma-number", "negation", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "adv-006", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Kiran ka bachcha nau din ka hai. Aankhen aur chehra peela hai, aur ab hatheli aur talve bhi peele dikh rahe hain. Doodh pee raha hai theek.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Kiran", "day": 9, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"jaundice": true, "jaundice_palms_soles": true}}, "flags": ["nb_jaundice_palms"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger", "name-like-word"]}
{"id": "adv-007", "lang": "mr", "script": "roman", "said": "Ashwini chi mulgi kaal janmali, aaj pahila divas. Tichya dolyat ani angavar pivlepana disto. Baki dudh nit pitey.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Ashwini", "day": 1, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"jaundice": true}}, "flags": ["nb_jaundice_early"], "tags": ["day-boundary"]}
{"id": "adv-008", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "पूजा का बच्चा बीस दिन का हो गया, अभी भी आँखें पीली हैं। हथेली पीली नहीं है। वजन तीन किलो एक सौ।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Pooja", "day": 20, "weight_g": 3100, "symptoms": {"jaundice": true, "jaundice_palms_soles": false}}, "flags": ["nb_jaundice_late"], "tags": ["negation", "name-like-word", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "adv-009", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Baby of Swati, day 14. I counted breaths for one full minute, it was exactly 60. No grunting, chest is not going in. Feeding okay, weight 3.2 kg.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Swati", "day": 14, "resp_rate": 60, "feeding": "good", "weight_g": 3200, "symptoms": {"chest_indrawing": false}}, "flags": ["nb_fast_breathing"], "tags": ["boundary", "clinical-english"]}
{"id": "adv-010", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Champa ka ladka, chautha din. Pasli chal rahi hai bahut, ginti ki toh ek minute mein chhiyasath saans. Bachcha sust pada hai, uthaane pe bhi aankh nahi kholta.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Champa", "day": 4, "resp_rate": 66, "symptoms": {"chest_indrawing": true, "lethargy": true}}, "flags": ["nb_chest_indrawing", "nb_fast_breathing", "nb_lethargy", "nb_sepsis_signs"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger", "numbers-in-words", "sepsis-count"]}
{"id": "adv-011", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "वंदनाच्या बाळाचा आठवा दिवस. नाळेभोवती लाल झालंय आणि थोडा पू येतोय. ताप नाही. दूध चांगलं पितं, वजन अडीच किलो.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Vandana", "day": 8, "weight_g": 2500, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"cord_pus": true, "hot_to_touch": false}}, "flags": ["nb_cord_infection"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger", "fractions", "boundary"]}
{"id": "adv-012", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Babita ka baby, saatva din. Thermometer mein 95.8 Fahrenheit aaya, poora badan thanda hai chhoone mein.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Babita", "day": 7, "temp_c": 35.4, "temp_f": 95.8, "symptoms": {"cold_to_touch": true}}, "flags": ["nb_hypothermia"], "tags": ["fahrenheit", "sepsis-count"]}
{"id": "adv-013", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "अनीता का बच्चा, ग्यारह दिन। वजन एक किलो नौ सौ... नहीं नहीं गलत बोला, दो किलो नौ सौ ग्राम। दूध ठीक पी रहा है।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Anita", "day": 11, "weight_g": 2900, "feeding": "good"}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "self-correction", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-014", "lang": "mix", "script": "roman", "said": "Rupali ka baby day 21 hai. Birth weight 1700 gram tha, ab weight 2350 hai, gain ho raha hai. Feeding achhi hai, koi problem nahi.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Rupali", "day": 21, "birth_weight_g": 1700, "weight_g": 2350, "feeding": "good"}, "flags": ["nb_at_risk_birth_weight", "nb_low_weight"], "tags": ["past-value", "hinglish", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "adv-015", "lang": "mr", "script": "roman", "said": "Pallavi chya balacha tisra divas, vajan paune don kilo, dudh kami pitay, radna halu ahe.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Pallavi", "day": 3, "weight_g": 1750, "feeding": "poor", "symptoms": {"weak_cry": true}}, "flags": ["nb_poor_feeding", "nb_sepsis_signs", "nb_very_low_weight", "nb_weak_cry"], "tags": ["fractions", "sepsis-count"]}
{"id": "adv-016", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Didi jaldi, Laxmi ka bachcha chhathe din ka hai, subah se bilkul nahi hil raha, doodh bhi nahi pee raha bilkul, honth neele se lag rahe.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Laxmi", "day": 6, "feeding": "none", "symptoms": {"lethargy": true}}, "flags": ["nb_lethargy", "nb_not_feeding", "nb_sepsis_signs"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger", "not-in-spec", "sepsis-count"]}
{"id": "adv-017", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Day 3 visit for baby of Geeta. Weight 3.05 kg, temperature 36.8 degree Celsius. Sucking well. No jaundice, no cord bleeding, no eye discharge, no pustules on skin.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Geeta", "day": 3, "weight_g": 3050, "temp_c": 36.8, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"jaundice": false, "cord_pus": false, "eye_discharge": false, "skin_pustules": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "negated-list", "clinical-english", "celsius", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-018", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Sapna ka baby, aaj das din poore. Vajan pandrah sau gram hai, janam ke samay satrah sau tha, kam ho gaya. Doodh kam pee raha hai.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Sapna", "day": 10, "weight_g": 1500, "birth_weight_g": 1700, "feeding": "poor"}, "flags": ["nb_at_risk_birth_weight", "nb_poor_feeding", "nb_very_low_weight", "nb_weight_loss"], "tags": ["past-value", "numbers-in-words", "name-like-word"]}
{"id": "adv-019", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "रुपाली नाही, सारिकाचं बाळ. चौदावा दिवस. वजन अठराशे ग्रॅम. दूध नीट पितं, जुलाब नाहीत.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Sarika", "day": 14, "weight_g": 1800, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"diarrhoea": false}}, "flags": ["nb_low_weight"], "tags": ["self-correction", "marathi-she-hundreds", "boundary", "negation", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "adv-020", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "शोभा के बच्चे का तापमान नापा, सैंतीस दशमलव पाँच डिग्री सेल्सियस है। आज चौथा दिन। दूध पी रहा है ठीक से।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Shobha", "day": 4, "temp_c": 37.5, "feeding": "good"}, "flags": ["nb_fever"], "tags": ["boundary", "celsius", "numbers-in-words", "temp-word-not-hot"]}
{"id": "adv-021", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Usha ka bachcha, satrah din. Kal raat badan garam tha, aaj subah se bilkul theek hai, garam nahi hai. Temperature 98.4 F. Doodh achha.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Usha", "day": 17, "temp_c": 36.9, "temp_f": 98.4, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"hot_to_touch": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "past-value", "fahrenheit", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-022", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Baby of Nisha, 12 days old. Loose motions since two days, around 8 times a day, and today I saw streaks of blood in the stool. Feeding is less.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Nisha", "day": 12, "feeding": "poor", "symptoms": {"diarrhoea": true, "blood_stool": true}}, "flags": ["nb_blood_stool", "nb_diarrhoea", "nb_poor_feeding"], "tags": ["duration-not-day", "clinical-english", "name-like-word"]}
{"id": "adv-023", "lang": "mr", "script": "roman", "said": "Jyoti chya balachi bhet, pachva divas. Jyotila khup taap ahe ani dokedukhi, pan bal theek ahe, dudh pita, vajan don hajar charshe gram.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Jyoti", "day": 5, "weight_g": 2400, "feeding": "good"}, "flags": ["nb_low_weight"], "tags": ["wrong-subject", "numbers-in-words", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "adv-024", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Manisha ki beti ka teesra hafta chal raha, aaj ikkisva din. Aankh se peela chipchipa paani aa raha hai aur pet pe chhote chhote pus wale daane hain.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Manisha", "day": 21, "symptoms": {"eye_discharge": true, "skin_pustules": true}}, "flags": ["nb_eye_discharge", "nb_skin_pustules"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger", "weeks-vs-day"]}
{"id": "adv-025", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "सुमन का बच्चा तेरह दिन का, हर बार दूध पीने के बाद उल्टी कर देता है, रोना भी बहुत धीमा है, और बदन ठंडा लग रहा है।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Suman", "day": 13, "symptoms": {"vomiting": true, "weak_cry": true, "cold_to_touch": true}}, "flags": ["nb_hypothermia", "nb_sepsis_signs", "nb_vomiting", "nb_weak_cry"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger", "sepsis-count"]}
{"id": "adv-026", "lang": "mix", "script": "roman", "said": "Khushi ka baby, day 7. Maine poocha jhatke aate hain? Bola nahi. Saans lene mein koi takleef nahi. Weight 3 kilo 100 gram. Doodh achha pee raha.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Khushi", "day": 7, "weight_g": 3100, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"convulsions": false, "difficulty_breathing": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "question-answer-negation", "name-like-word", "kilo-gram", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-027", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Kavita ka baby, aath din. Kavita ki behen ko kal mirgi ka daura pada tha, usko hospital le gaye. Baby ko kuch nahi, doodh peeta hai, vajan dhai kilo.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Kavita", "day": 8, "weight_g": 2500, "feeding": "good"}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "wrong-subject", "fractions", "boundary", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-028", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "मंगलच्या बाळाला आज सकाळपासून दोनदा आकडी आली, हातपाय झटकतो. बाळ दहा दिवसांचं. तापमान शंभर फॅरनहाइट.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Mangal", "day": 10, "temp_c": 37.8, "temp_f": 100, "symptoms": {"convulsions": true}}, "flags": ["nb_convulsions", "nb_fever"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger", "fahrenheit", "temp-word-not-hot"]}
{"id": "adv-029", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Heera ka beta, pandrahva din. Tapman dekha toh abhi 99 degree hai. Aankhen thodi peeli hain. Doodh theek.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Heera", "day": 15, "temp_c": 37.2, "temp_f": 99, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"jaundice": true}}, "flags": ["nb_jaundice_late"], "tags": ["unitless-temp", "boundary", "temp-word-not-hot", "day-boundary"]}
{"id": "adv-030", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Baby of Archana, day 5. Mother says baby is struggling to breathe, there is a grunting sound and the nostrils are flaring. Respiratory rate 52.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Archana", "day": 5, "resp_rate": 52, "symptoms": {"difficulty_breathing": true}}, "flags": ["nb_difficulty_breathing"], "tags": ["clinical-english"]}
{"id": "adv-031", "lang": "mr", "script": "roman", "said": "Ho tai, Dhanashri cha bal, ekvisava divas. Vajan teen kilo teen she gram. Dudh changla pita, kavil nahi, taap nahi, julab nahi. Sagla barobar.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Dhanashri", "day": 21, "weight_g": 3300, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"jaundice": false, "hot_to_touch": false, "diarrhoea": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "negated-list", "filler", "marathi-she-hundreds", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-032", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "चंदा का बच्चा, छठा दिन। पिछली बार साँस बासठ थी, आज गिनी तो अड़तालीस प्रति मिनट। दूध अच्छे से पी रहा है, पसली नहीं चल रही।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Chanda", "day": 6, "resp_rate": 48, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"chest_indrawing": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "past-value", "name-like-word", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-033", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Phoolmati ka bachcha, ghar pe paida hua, aaj doosra din. Ek kilo saadhe saat sau gram vajan. Badan thanda hai, doodh kam kheench raha.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Phoolmati", "day": 2, "weight_g": 1750, "feeding": "poor", "symptoms": {"cold_to_touch": true}}, "flags": ["nb_hypothermia", "nb_poor_feeding", "nb_sepsis_signs", "nb_very_low_weight"], "tags": ["fractions", "kilo-gram", "sepsis-count"]}
{"id": "adv-034", "lang": "mix", "script": "devanagari", "said": "सरिता का बेबी, डे सेवन। वेट दो पॉइंट दो किलो, टेम्परेचर नाइंटी सेवन पॉइंट फ़ाइव फ़ारेनहाइट। फीडिंग ठीक है, नो वोमिटिंग।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Sarita", "day": 7, "weight_g": 2200, "temp_c": 36.4, "temp_f": 97.5, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"vomiting": false}}, "flags": ["nb_cool", "nb_low_weight"], "tags": ["english-in-devanagari", "fahrenheit", "negation", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "adv-035", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Pinki ka naya baby, tees din ka. Uski badi beti ko teen din se bukhar aur ulti hai. Naye baby ko koi dikkat nahi, doodh pee raha, vajan saadhe teen kilo.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Pinki", "day": 30, "weight_g": 3500, "feeding": "good"}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "wrong-subject", "fractions", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-036", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Baby of Shanti, day 3. Breathing around 58 to 62 per minute when I counted. Feeding fine. Mild yellowness on the face.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Shanti", "day": 3, "resp_rate": 62, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"jaundice": true}}, "flags": ["nb_fast_breathing"], "tags": ["range", "name-like-word", "noted-not-flag"]}
{"id": "adv-037", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "सुषमाच्या बाळाचा बारावा दिवस. अंग खूप गरम आहे, बाळ सुस्त पडलंय, हलवलं तरच थोडी हालचाल करतं. वजन दीड किलो.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Sushma", "day": 12, "weight_g": 1500, "symptoms": {"hot_to_touch": true, "lethargy": true}}, "flags": ["nb_fever", "nb_lethargy", "nb_sepsis_signs", "nb_very_low_weight"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger", "fractions", "sepsis-count"]}
{"id": "adv-038", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Mamta ki beti, chautha din, naal se khoon ris raha hai thoda thoda, vajan sava do kilo. Baaki sab theek, doodh achha.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Mamta", "day": 4, "weight_g": 2250, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"cord_pus": true}}, "flags": ["nb_cord_infection", "nb_low_weight"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger", "fractions", "name-like-word"]}
{"id": "adv-039", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Baby of Komal, day 28. Weight showing 7.2 kg on the scale, I think the scale is wrong. Feeding well, no fever.", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Komal", "day": 28, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"hot_to_touch": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "implausible-weight", "name-like-word", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-040", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "नमस्ते दीदी, मैं आज रानी के घर गई थी, उसका बच्चा बाईस दिन का है। रानी की सास कह रही थी कि बच्चा रात भर रोता है, पर रोना तेज़ है, कमज़ोर नहीं। दो दिन से पतले दस्त हो रहे हैं, दिन में छह सात बार। दूध पी रहा है ठीक। वजन तीन किलो दो सौ। उल्टी नहीं है।", "record": {"type": "newborn", "name": "Rani", "day": 22, "weight_g": 3200, "feeding": "good", "symptoms": {"weak_cry": false, "diarrhoea": true, "vomiting": false}}, "flags": ["nb_diarrhoea"], "tags": ["long-rambling", "duration-not-day", "name-like-word", "negation", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "adv-041", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Sangita, aathva mahina. BP upar wala 148 neeche wala 96, albumin plus plus aaya. Pairon mein sujan hai, haath aur chehre pe nahi.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Sangita", "month": 8, "bp_sys": 148, "bp_dia": 96, "albumin": "2", "symptoms": {"swelling_feet": true, "swelling_face_hands": false}}, "flags": ["anc_preeclampsia"], "tags": ["bp-upar-neeche", "albumin-plus-plus", "feet-vs-face"]}
{"id": "adv-042", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "कमला का सातवाँ महीना है, बीपी एक सौ पचपन बटा एक सौ दस। सिर में बहुत तेज़ दर्द है सुबह से।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Kamala", "month": 7, "bp_sys": 155, "bp_dia": 110, "symptoms": {"severe_headache": true}}, "flags": ["anc_headache_vision", "anc_severe_hypertension"], "tags": ["bp-bata", "boundary", "numbers-in-words", "name-like-word"]}
{"id": "adv-043", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Patient Lata, 34 weeks. BP 150 by 100, sorry, I read it wrong, it is 170 by 114. Albumin 3 plus. Complains of blurring of vision.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Lata", "weeks": 34, "bp_sys": 170, "bp_dia": 114, "albumin": "3", "symptoms": {"blurred_vision": true}}, "flags": ["anc_headache_vision", "anc_imminent_eclampsia", "anc_preeclampsia"], "tags": ["self-correction", "clinical-english", "rule-overlap"]}
{"id": "adv-044", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "उज्ज्वला, सहावा महिना. हिमोग्लोबिन साडेसहा आलं. चक्कर येते, डोळ्यांसमोर अंधारी येते, दम लागतो चालताना.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Ujwala", "month": 6, "hb": 6.5, "symptoms": {"dizziness": true, "breathless": true}}, "flags": ["anc_breathless", "anc_dizziness", "anc_severe_anaemia"], "tags": ["fractions", "colloquial-danger"]}
{"id": "adv-045", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Seema ka paanchva mahina. Pichhli baar Hb 6.9 tha, iron ki goli kha rahi, ab aaj 9.4 aaya. Tees goliyan aur di.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Seema", "month": 5, "hb": 9.4, "ifa_tablets": 30}, "flags": ["anc_moderate_anaemia"], "tags": ["past-value", "numbers-in-words", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "adv-046", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "आरती, बत्तीस हफ्ते। बीपी एक सौ दस बटा सत्तर, हीमोग्लोबिन ग्यारह दशमलव दो। खून नहीं जा रहा, पानी नहीं जा रहा, बच्चा अच्छे से हिल रहा है।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Aarti", "weeks": 32, "bp_sys": 110, "bp_dia": 70, "hb": 11.2, "fetal_movement": "normal", "symptoms": {"bleeding": false, "leaking_fluid": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "negated-list", "numbers-in-words", "bp-bata", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-047", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "ANC visit, Priti, 28 weeks. Patient denies bleeding, leaking, headache or blurring of vision. Fetal movements present and normal. Weight 58 kg. BP 118/76.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Priti", "weeks": 28, "weight_kg": 58, "bp_sys": 118, "bp_dia": 76, "fetal_movement": "normal", "symptoms": {"bleeding": false, "leaking_fluid": false, "severe_headache": false, "blurred_vision": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "denies-list", "clinical-english", "bp-slash", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-048", "lang": "mr", "script": "roman", "said": "Rinku, navva mahina. Kal sandhyakalpasun bal potat halat nahi ahe, ajibat halchal nahi. Pot pan khup dukhtay.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Rinku", "month": 9, "fetal_movement": "absent", "symptoms": {"abdominal_pain": true}}, "flags": ["anc_abdominal_pain", "anc_fetal_movement"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger", "negation-is-danger"]}
{"id": "adv-049", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Bhavna ka nauva mahina chal raha hai, subah se neeche se paani ja raha hai, kapde geele ho gaye. Dard abhi halka hai, labour wala nahi.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Bhavna", "month": 9, "symptoms": {"leaking_fluid": true, "labour_pain": false}}, "flags": ["anc_leaking"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger", "mild-vs-severe", "not-in-spec"]}
{"id": "adv-050", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "रजनी की सास को तीन दिन से बुखार है, उन्हें दवा दी। रजनी का आठवाँ महीना, उसको बुखार नहीं है, बीपी एक सौ बीस बटा अस्सी।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Rajni", "month": 8, "bp_sys": 120, "bp_dia": 80, "symptoms": {"fever": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "wrong-subject", "negation", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-051", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Mrs. Anjali, 36 weeks. BP one forty over ninety. Urine albumin nil. No headache.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Anjali", "weeks": 36, "bp_sys": 140, "bp_dia": 90, "albumin": "nil", "symptoms": {"severe_headache": false}}, "flags": ["anc_hypertension"], "tags": ["boundary", "bp-words-over", "clinical-english"]}
{"id": "adv-052", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "सोनाली, वय सतरा वर्षे, सातवा महिना, सोनोग्राफीत जुळी मुलं आहेत असं सांगितलं.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Sonali", "age": 17, "month": 7, "twins": true}, "flags": ["anc_high_risk", "anc_multiple_pregnancy"], "tags": ["risk-items", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "adv-053", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Durga, doosri pregnancy, pehla bachcha operation se hua tha. Lambai 145 centimeter, umar 35 saal. Chhatha mahina.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Durga", "prev_caesarean": true, "height_cm": 145, "age": 35, "month": 6}, "flags": ["anc_high_risk"], "tags": ["risk-items", "boundary", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "adv-054", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Meera, umar chhattis saal, lambai ek sau chawalis cm, pehli baar pregnant, teesra mahina. Koi taklif nahi.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Meera", "age": 36, "height_cm": 144, "month": 3}, "flags": ["anc_high_risk"], "tags": ["risk-items", "boundary", "numbers-in-words", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "adv-055", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Called from home: Neha, full term, labour pains for 12 hours now, water bag not burst yet, no bleeding.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Neha", "labour_hours": 12, "symptoms": {"leaking_fluid": false, "bleeding": false, "labour_pain": true}}, "flags": ["anc_labour"], "tags": ["normal", "boundary", "negation"]}
{"id": "adv-056", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "ललिता को तेरह घंटे से दर्द हो रहा है, अभी बच्चा नहीं हुआ, घर पर ही है।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Lalita", "labour_hours": 13}, "flags": ["anc_labour_prolonged"], "tags": ["numbers-in-words", "boundary"]}
{"id": "adv-057", "lang": "mr", "script": "roman", "said": "Vaishali, satva mahina. Thoda thoda raktasrav hotoy, lal daag kapdyavar. Pani jat nahi.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Vaishali", "month": 7, "symptoms": {"bleeding": true, "leaking_fluid": false}}, "flags": ["anc_bleeding"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger", "mild-still-danger", "negation"]}
{"id": "adv-058", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Asha naam ki mahila hai, chhatha mahina. Uska khoon nikala tha jaanch ke liye, report abhi nahi aayi. Koi bleeding nahi hai. Vajan 52 kilo.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Asha", "month": 6, "weight_kg": 52, "symptoms": {"bleeding": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "name-like-word", "khoon-not-hb", "negation", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-059", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "गायत्री, नौवाँ महीना, चेहरे और हाथों पर सूजन आ गई है, अंगूठी टाइट हो गई। बीपी एक सौ अड़तीस बटा अट्ठासी।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Gayatri", "month": 9, "bp_sys": 138, "bp_dia": 88, "symptoms": {"swelling_face_hands": true}}, "flags": ["anc_swelling"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger", "boundary", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "adv-060", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Pregnant woman Farzana, 22 weeks, complains of burning while passing urine and white discharge with bad smell. No fever.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Farzana", "weeks": 22, "symptoms": {"burning_urine": true, "foul_discharge": true, "fever": false}}, "flags": ["anc_burning_urine", "anc_discharge"], "tags": ["clinical-english", "negation"]}
{"id": "adv-061", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Rinki ka teesra mahina, din mein chaar paanch baar ulti ho rahi, khana nahi tik raha. Halka sa sir dard rehta hai, aankhon se saaf dikhta hai.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Rinki", "month": 3, "symptoms": {"vomiting": true, "blurred_vision": false}}, "flags": ["anc_vomiting"], "tags": ["mild-vs-severe", "not-in-spec", "negation", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "adv-062", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "शीतलच्या मागच्या बाळंतपणात तिला आकडी आली होती. आता पाचवा महिना, तिच्या बहिणीला पण फिट येतात, पण शीतलला यावेळी काही त्रास नाही.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Sheetal", "prev_eclampsia": true, "month": 5}, "flags": ["anc_high_risk"], "tags": ["wrong-subject", "past-value", "risk-items", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "adv-063", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Savitri ko kal se tez bukhar hai, kaanp rahi hai, aathva mahina. Saans bhi phool rahi hai.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Savitri", "month": 8, "symptoms": {"fever": true, "breathless": true, "high_fever": true}}, "flags": ["anc_breathless", "anc_high_fever"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger"]}
{"id": "adv-064", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Divya, 26 weeks, Hb ten point five, given 60 IFA tablets, BP 112/72. Feels a bit giddy sometimes.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Divya", "weeks": 26, "hb": 10.5, "ifa_tablets": 60, "bp_sys": 112, "bp_dia": 72, "symptoms": {"dizziness": true}}, "flags": ["anc_dizziness", "anc_mild_anaemia"], "tags": ["numbers-in-words", "clinical-english", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "adv-065", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "गुड्डी का आठवाँ महीना, बीपी डेढ़ सौ पर सौ, एल्ब्यूमिन एक प्लस। सिर दर्द नहीं, धुंधला नहीं दिखता।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Guddi", "month": 8, "bp_sys": 150, "bp_dia": 100, "albumin": "1", "symptoms": {"severe_headache": false, "blurred_vision": false}}, "flags": ["anc_hypertension"], "tags": ["fractions", "bp-par", "negated-list"]}
{"id": "adv-066", "lang": "mr", "script": "roman", "said": "Manda, aathva mahina, BP ekshe saath bay navvad, albumin nahi. Dokedukhi nahi.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Manda", "month": 8, "bp_sys": 160, "bp_dia": 90, "albumin": "nil", "symptoms": {"severe_headache": false}}, "flags": ["anc_severe_hypertension"], "tags": ["marathi-she-hundreds", "boundary", "negation"]}
{"id": "adv-067", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Shabnam, chaubees hafte, yaani chhatha mahina samjho. Peshaab mein jalan hai. Baaki theek.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Shabnam", "weeks": 24, "month": 6, "symptoms": {"burning_urine": true}}, "flags": ["anc_burning_urine"], "tags": ["months-vs-weeks", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "adv-068", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Registration visit for Mariam, 14 weeks, third pregnancy. Last delivery she had heavy bleeding after the baby came, needed blood. No bleeding in this pregnancy so far.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Mariam", "weeks": 14, "prev_pph": true, "symptoms": {"bleeding": false}}, "flags": ["anc_high_risk"], "tags": ["past-value", "risk-items", "negation", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "adv-069", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "रेशमा, पाँचवाँ महीना। उसके दो साल के बच्चे को कल से बुखार है, रेशमा को बुखार नहीं। वजन पचपन किलो, आयरन की साठ गोलियाँ दीं। उल्टी नहीं।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Reshma", "month": 5, "weight_kg": 55, "ifa_tablets": 60, "symptoms": {"fever": false, "vomiting": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "wrong-subject", "numbers-in-words", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-070", "lang": "mix", "script": "roman", "said": "Nandini 30 weeks, last time BP 150/96 tha, aaj recheck kiya toh 128/84. Pairon mein swelling nahi, chehre pe bhi nahi, headache nahi.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Nandini", "weeks": 30, "bp_sys": 128, "bp_dia": 84, "symptoms": {"swelling_feet": false, "swelling_face_hands": false, "severe_headache": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "past-value", "hinglish", "bp-slash", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-071", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "स्नेहा, आठवा महिना. बीपी एकशे वीस बाय ऐंशी, हिमोग्लोबिन साडेअकरा. बाळाची हालचाल चांगली आहे. पायाला सूज नाही.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Sneha", "month": 8, "bp_sys": 120, "bp_dia": 80, "hb": 11.5, "fetal_movement": "normal", "symptoms": {"swelling_feet": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "marathi-she-hundreds", "fractions", "negation", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-072", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Kusum ki saas ko chakkar aate hain, BP ki dawai leti hain. Kusum ka saatva mahina, BP sava sau by assi, use koi chakkar nahi.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Kusum", "month": 7, "bp_sys": 125, "bp_dia": 80, "symptoms": {"dizziness": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "wrong-subject", "fractions", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-073", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Manju, 35 weeks, says baby movements are less since yesterday, only 3-4 kicks today. Hb 8 point 2.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Manju", "weeks": 35, "fetal_movement": "reduced", "hb": 8.2}, "flags": ["anc_fetal_movement", "anc_moderate_anaemia"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "adv-074", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "तारा को अभी दौरा पड़ा, दाँत भींच गए, मुँह से झाग, नौवाँ महीना है, जल्दी गाड़ी भेजो।", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Tara", "month": 9, "symptoms": {"convulsions": true}}, "flags": ["anc_convulsions"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger", "name-like-word"]}
{"id": "adv-075", "lang": "mr", "script": "roman", "said": "Kalpana, chautha mahina, hemoglobin saat point don, vajan chalis kilo, ulti nahi.", "record": {"type": "anc", "name": "Kalpana", "month": 4, "hb": 7.2, "weight_kg": 40, "symptoms": {"vomiting": false}}, "flags": ["anc_moderate_anaemia"], "tags": ["numbers-in-words", "boundary", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "adv-076", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Parvati ki delivery ko teen din hue, ghante bhar mein pad bheeg jaata hai, chakkar bhi aa rahe.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Parvati", "day": 3, "symptoms": {"heavy_bleeding": true, "dizziness": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_anaemia_signs", "pnc_heavy_bleeding"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger"]}
{"id": "adv-077", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "माधुरीच्या बाळंतपणाला पाच दिवस झाले, दिवसाला चार पाच पॅड लागतात, ताप नाही.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Madhuri", "day": 5, "pads": 5, "symptoms": {"fever": false}}, "flags": ["pnc_heavy_bleeding"], "tags": ["range", "boundary", "negation"]}
{"id": "adv-078", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "PNC day 7, Sunanda. Pads 2 per day, temperature 98.2 F, BP 118/78. Breasts soft, no pain. No foul smell.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Sunanda", "day": 7, "pads": 2, "temp_c": 36.8, "temp_f": 98.2, "bp_sys": 118, "bp_dia": 78, "symptoms": {"breast_problem": false, "foul_discharge": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "clinical-english", "fahrenheit", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-079", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "पूनम, डिलीवरी के बाद चौथा दिन, थर्मामीटर में एक सौ दो फ़ारेनहाइट आया। पेशाब में जलन नहीं, बदबू वाला पानी नहीं।", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Poonam", "day": 4, "temp_c": 38.9, "temp_f": 102, "symptoms": {"burning_urine": false, "foul_discharge": false}}, "flags": ["pnc_fever"], "tags": ["boundary", "fahrenheit", "numbers-in-words", "negation"]}
{"id": "adv-080", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Rubina ko delivery ke baad chhatha din, temperature 39 degree Celsius, neeche se badboodaar paani aa raha.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Rubina", "day": 6, "temp_c": 39.0, "symptoms": {"foul_discharge": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_high_fever", "pnc_sepsis"], "tags": ["celsius", "boundary", "fever-exclusion"]}
{"id": "adv-081", "lang": "mix", "script": "roman", "said": "Jayashri, PNC day 10, thermometer var 38.9 Celsius, urine pass kartana burning hote.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Jayashri", "day": 10, "temp_c": 38.9, "symptoms": {"burning_urine": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_uti"], "tags": ["boundary", "celsius", "fever-exclusion", "marathi-english"]}
{"id": "adv-082", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "निर्मला की डिलीवरी को ग्यारह दिन हुए। बच्चे को पीलिया है, आँखें पीली हैं। निर्मला ठीक है, दिन में दो पैड, बुखार नहीं।", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Nirmala", "day": 11, "pads": 2, "symptoms": {"fever": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "wrong-subject", "negation", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-083", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Postnatal day 2, Kamini, BP 164/104, complains of severe headache and blurred vision.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Kamini", "day": 2, "bp_sys": 164, "bp_dia": 104, "symptoms": {"severe_headache": true, "blurred_vision": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_headache", "pnc_neuro", "pnc_severe_hypertension"], "tags": ["clinical-english", "bp-slash"]}
{"id": "adv-084", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Bindu ka paanchva din, BP ek sau bayalis by atthasi. Sir dard nahi, saans theek.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Bindu", "day": 5, "bp_sys": 142, "bp_dia": 88, "symptoms": {"severe_headache": false, "breathless": false}}, "flags": ["pnc_hypertension"], "tags": ["numbers-in-words", "negation"]}
{"id": "adv-085", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "सुवर्णा, बाळंतपणानंतर पंधरावा दिवस, हिमोग्लोबिन सहा पॉइंट आठ, चेहरा पांढरा पडलाय.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Suvarna", "day": 15, "hb": 6.8, "symptoms": {"pallor": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_severe_anaemia"], "tags": ["numbers-in-words", "colloquial-danger"]}
{"id": "adv-086", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Didi, Sushila ko delivery ke doosre din aankhen upar chadh gayi aur haath pair akad gaye, do minute tak, ab behosh si hai.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Sushila", "day": 2, "symptoms": {"convulsions": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_convulsions"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger", "not-in-spec"]}
{"id": "adv-087", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Mother Leela, day 9 after delivery. Family says she is talking irrelevant, not making sense since morning. No fits. No fever.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Leela", "day": 9, "symptoms": {"abnormal_speech": true, "convulsions": false, "fever": false}}, "flags": ["pnc_neuro"], "tags": ["indian-english", "negation"]}
{"id": "adv-088", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "रीना, डिलीवरी को बारह दिन, दाहिने स्तन में गाँठ और दर्द है, लाल है। बुखार नहीं।", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Reena", "day": 12, "symptoms": {"breast_problem": true, "fever": false}}, "flags": ["pnc_breast"], "tags": ["negation"]}
{"id": "adv-089", "lang": "mix", "script": "roman", "said": "Shalini ka day 8 PNC, uski aankhen peeli hain, baby ki bhi. Pads 3 a day, BP 120/80.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Shalini", "day": 8, "pads": 3, "bp_sys": 120, "bp_dia": 80, "symptoms": {"jaundice": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_jaundice"], "tags": ["subject-both", "hinglish"]}
{"id": "adv-090", "lang": "mr", "script": "roman", "said": "Kamal tai, bali zalyavar vis divas, laghvi thambavta yet nahi, kapde ole hotat. Taap nahi.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Kamal", "day": 20, "symptoms": {"incontinence": true, "fever": false}}, "flags": ["pnc_incontinence"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger", "name-like-word", "negation-is-danger"]}
{"id": "adv-091", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Haan ji didi, main Saroj ke ghar gayi thi aaj, unki delivery ko satrah din ho gaye. Woh theek hai, khana kha rahi hai, din mein ek do pad, bukhar nahi hai, pet mein dard nahi, peshab theek hai jalan nahi. Unki jethani ko bukhar tha woh alag baat hai. BP 112 by 70 tha jo ANM ne naapa.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Saroj", "day": 17, "pads": 2, "bp_sys": 112, "bp_dia": 70, "symptoms": {"fever": false, "abdominal_pain": false, "burning_urine": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "long-rambling", "wrong-subject", "range", "negated-list", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-092", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "अंजू, डिलीवरी को तीसरा दिन, दिन में तीन पैड, खून ज़्यादा नहीं जा रहा, स्तन में कोई परेशानी नहीं।", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Anju", "day": 3, "pads": 3, "symptoms": {"heavy_bleeding": false, "breast_problem": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "negation", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-093", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "PNC visit, Fatima, day 4. Temperature 100.4 F, has chills. Severe lower abdominal pain. No foul discharge, no burning urine.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Fatima", "day": 4, "temp_c": 38.0, "temp_f": 100.4, "symptoms": {"abdominal_pain": true, "foul_discharge": false, "burning_urine": false}}, "flags": ["pnc_abdominal_pain", "pnc_fever"], "tags": ["clinical-english", "fahrenheit", "negation"]}
{"id": "adv-094", "lang": "mr", "script": "devanagari", "said": "मीनलच्या बाळंतपणाला सहा दिवस, चेहऱ्यावर आणि हातावर सूज आली आहे, दम लागतो.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Meenal", "day": 6, "symptoms": {"swelling_face_hands": true, "breathless": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_breathless", "pnc_swelling"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger"]}
{"id": "adv-095", "lang": "hi", "script": "roman", "said": "Kalavati, aathva din, din mein chhe pad, nahi nahi sorry, teen pad lag rahe. Bukhar nahi.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Kalavati", "day": 8, "pads": 3, "symptoms": {"fever": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "self-correction", "negation", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-096", "lang": "mix", "script": "devanagari", "said": "प्रिया, PNC डे फ़ोर्टी, बीपी वन थर्टी बाय एटी फ़ाइव, एचबी टेन पॉइंट टू।", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Priya", "day": 40, "bp_sys": 130, "bp_dia": 85, "hb": 10.2}, "flags": ["pnc_moderate_anaemia"], "tags": ["normal", "english-in-devanagari", "numbers-in-words", "watch-only"]}
{"id": "adv-097", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Mother Gauri, day 5, temperature was 102 last night, now 103 when I checked. Burning urine also.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Gauri", "day": 5, "temp_c": 39.4, "temp_f": 103, "symptoms": {"burning_urine": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_high_fever", "pnc_uti"], "tags": ["past-value", "unitless-temp", "fever-exclusion"]}
{"id": "adv-098", "lang": "hi", "script": "devanagari", "said": "राधा, डिलीवरी को नौ दिन, कल चक्कर आए थे, आज ठीक है, चक्कर नहीं। एक दिन में चार पैड।", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Radha", "day": 9, "pads": 4, "symptoms": {"dizziness": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "past-value", "boundary", "normal-visit"]}
{"id": "adv-099", "lang": "mr", "script": "roman", "said": "Yogita, dusra divas, khup raktasrav hotoy, gaadi bharun, hemoglobin aath.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Yogita", "day": 2, "hb": 8.0, "symptoms": {"heavy_bleeding": true}}, "flags": ["pnc_heavy_bleeding", "pnc_moderate_anaemia"], "tags": ["colloquial-danger", "numbers-in-words"]}
{"id": "adv-100", "lang": "en", "script": "roman", "said": "Day 42 PNC for Ritu. No complaints of fever, bleeding, breast pain or burning urine. BP 110/70.", "record": {"type": "pnc", "name": "Ritu", "day": 42, "bp_sys": 110, "bp_dia": 70, "symptoms": {"fever": false, "heavy_bleeding": false, "breast_problem": false, "burning_urine": false}}, "flags": [], "tags": ["normal", "negated-list", "clinical-english", "normal-visit"]}
